          "headline": "Extreme Heat Warning issued October 8 at 4:57AM PDT until October 8 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Los Angeles/Oxnard CA",
          "description": "* WHAT...Dangerously hot conditions with temperatures reaching 90 to\n100 at the coast and 106 in the valleys.\n\n* WHERE...Coast and valleys of Los Angeles and Ventura Counties.\n\n* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Heat related illnesses increase significantly during\nextreme heat events.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Very hot temperatures are likely to continue\ninto the second week of October, possibly requiring an extension of\nthis product.",
